      "mergedPostDetails": "When loading into some worlds with a VRC_PortalMarker prefab, the portal seems to keep spawning infinitely causing a massive drop in frames and eventual crash. \nThe world tested was on open beta, a community labs world, and the portal was to a community labs world. \nSample World: \nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_78343e89-8eeb-4d82-b26b-d587d8eac3f7\nThe log is spammed with fetching the world image for the portal which probably is the cause of the bulk of the lag. \nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/779692117374009376/1010754281818837092/unknown.png\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/779692117374009376/1010754282171138118/2022-08-20.22-36.00-VRChat.mp4",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1225] Community Labs Portal Prefab spawn infinitely and cause lag",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "6301493f06b9c344b5bec823",
