      "mergeID": "6303fb0aecb7f944bba2f11a",
      "mergedPostDetails": "It looks like Beta version massively duplicates portals in certain worlds (1 portal turns into like 50 100..). You're constantly at 11fps. When you try to re-join them you get a never ending black screen and have to restart the game. I am 100% positive it is beta as I have tried it with live client and beta.\n\nDiscord picture link to the duplicates portals: https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/978277944956956672/1011274786707607552/unknown.png?width=1404&height=671",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Beta massively duplicates Portals in some worlds",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "6301493f06b9c344b5bec823",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
      "synthetic": true,
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "_id": "6303fb1807106044cbb15ffa",
      "author": {
        "_id": "604af146155eb70d8d4d5a1f",
        "alias": "Empty Moose",
        "aliasID": "65c2a286ed6eefce4c72d251",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/ade3a62c60c5e56293c48e37a7b03576.png",
        "created": "2021-03-12T04:42:46.191Z",
        "name": "Fusl",
        "serviceAccount": false,
