      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "6303fb1807106044cbb15ffa",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I've discovered that in certain worlds the world portals appear to continuously duplicate themselves in the current beta.\nThis duplication completely tanks the framerates down to near unplayable levels. I think it may be effectively causing a memory leak as well, since the framerate continues to drop the longer a user remains in the instance.\nSteps to reproduce, go to a world with a portal, if needed one that definitely has issues see \"After The Rain\" by \"Sumeru\", or \"Jazztronauts Bar\" by \"Floober\".\nThe world portal will have a very exaggerated border glow, and the framerate will continuously decrease.\nSee screenshots.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "World portals duplicate themselves continuously",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "6301493f06b9c344b5bec823",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
      "synthetic": true,
      "value": ""
    },
