      "mergeID": "6303fb739b76e678080bafae",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Basically unplayable on vr and desktop. Was bad in the live version but is 100x worse in the beta. When this version goes live I actually will not be able to play anymore. Not sure what's causing it but anytime I open the game my frames are extremely worse than they were before eac. for context I was getting around 90 in my homeworld on desktop and anywhere from 40-50 in vr. Now on BOTH vr and desktop my frames drop to a steady 11 and do not move and then my game crashes. The game is pretty much unplayable for me now so thanks for that I guess. I previously used performance enhancement mods to make the game run better on my pc, now those are gone and I cannot play the game anymore at all basically.",
